As you probably know, the Air Elementals on the Air Plane are pretty nasty. 
Their damage bypasses your AC, and they can knock you down to little health 
very quickly.

I've seen a few different ways of dealing with them (polymorph, 
teleportation) etc but I found out a good way on my last visit there.

If you have the spell Charm Monster, you can actually charm the Elemental 
while you are inside of it. It will then expel you and it will also be your 
pet. They make pretty decent pets on the plains, and they will engulf a lot 
of the enemies that you will go up against.

I'm not sure if this is a well known tactic or not, but it really helped me 
a lot.

